meta {
  name: Get All Error
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/error
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Error

  This request is used to get all error audit. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes (Admin only), and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Error fetched successfully.** Ordered in ascending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "error fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "message": "lorem ipsum",
          "stack_trace": "lorem ipsum",
          "file": "welcome.php",
          "line": 2,
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47",
          "faced_by": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — error failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "error not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}